WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,580
Zixuan, what happened to you today?

2
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,380
Did Team Wu’s departure hit you so hard?

3
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,540
The normal tasks of the second team are not much more dangerous than this. Look at this.

4
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:21,610
I didn’t expect Cui Zixuan to be so timid

5
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,360
It seems that he was forced to lead a search team

6
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,520
Keep trying to persuade teammates to quit

7
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,190
The director did not reveal any information about the plot

8
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,020
Pretty smart
